{"id": "4755a531-f1cf-4650-9142-fcdec4a2cad3", "slug": "organic-material-system-spatial-interface", "title": "Organic Material System - Spatial Interface", "description": "Organic Material UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Organic Material System - Spatial Interface\"\ndescription: \"Organic Material UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#C2410C\"\n  secondary: \"#450A0A\"\n  accent: \"#450A0A\"\n  background: \"#450A0A\"\n  surface: \"#FECDD3\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Organic Material System - Spatial Interface\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 9; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, threejs, charts, bento, animated, webgl, effect.\n## Overview\nOrganic Material UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nEngage Depth LYR-07 ONYX STONE #1C1917 R:28 G:25 B:23 ALABASTER MATTE LYR-05 #FAFAF9 R:250 G:250 B:249 FOREST CANOPY LYR-02 #064E3B R:6 G:78 B:59 BURNT TERRACOTTA LYR-01 #C2410C R:194 G:65 B:12 LYR-04 GOLDEN OCHRE #FBBF…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: ONYX STONE; ALABASTER MATTE; FOREST CANOPY; BURNT TERRACOTTA; GOLDEN OCHRE; DUSTY ROSE.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #C2410C, secondary #450A0A, accent #450A0A, background #450A0A, surface #FECDD3, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Organic Material System - Spatial Interface</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-stone-100 text-stone-900 font-sans antialiased overflow-hidden w-screen h-screen m-0 p-0 selection:bg-orange-700 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Layer -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none opacity-40\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Master 3D Perspective Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-screen h-screen flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"perspective: 1400px;\">\n\n        <!-- Interactive Hint -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-stone-500 pointer-events-none z-50\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cursor-hover-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-3xl animate-pulse\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-extralight tracking-widest uppercase\">Engage Depth</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 3D Scene Wrapper -->\n        <div id=\"composition-container\" class=\"relative w-[90vw] sm:w-[75vw] lg:w-[900px] h-[75vh] lg:h-[650px] cursor-crosshair\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n\n            <!-- Layer 07: Onyx Stone (Deepest Base) -->\n            <div class=\"color-card absolute shadow-2xl shadow-stone-900/40 flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 rounded-sm\"\n                 style=\"top: 8%; left: 2%; width: 32%; height: 28%; transform-style: preserve-3d;\"\n                 data-ex=\"-90\" data-ey=\"-70\" data-ez=\"-250\" data-erx=\"-8\" data-ery=\"-6\" data-erz=\"-12\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-stone-500 tracking-wider\">LYR-07</span>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg font-extralight tracking-tight text-stone-100 uppercase reveal-text leading-none\">ONYX STONE</h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-stone-400 flex justify-between items-end\">\n                    <div>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-light text-stone-300\">#1C1917</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-extralight mt-1 text-stone-500\">R:28 G:25 B:23</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Layer 05: Alabaster Matte -->\n            <div class=\"color-card absolute shadow-xl shadow-stone-300/50 flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-6 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/50 rounded-sm\"\n                 style=\"top: 18%; left: 22%; width: 38%; height: 42%; transform-style: preserve-3d;\"\n                 data-ex=\"-20\" data-ey=\"-50\" data-ez=\"-80\" data-erx=\"-3\" data-ery=\"2\" data-erz=\"4\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-sm sm:text-lg lg:text-xl font-light tracking-tight text-stone-800 uppercase reveal-text max-w-[70%] leading-none\">ALABASTER MATTE</h2>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-stone-400 tracking-wider\">LYR-05</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-stone-600\">\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-light text-stone-800\">#FAFAF9</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-extralight mt-1 text-stone-400\">R:250 G:250 B:249</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Layer 02: Forest Canopy -->\n            <div class=\"color-card absolute shadow-2xl shadow-emerald-950/30 flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 bg-emerald-900 rounded-sm\"\n                 style=\"top: 58%; left: 8%; width: 38%; height: 22%; transform-style: preserve-3d;\"\n                 data-ex=\"-110\" data-ey=\"90\" data-ez=\"20\" data-erx=\"8\" data-ery=\"-12\" data-erz=\"6\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg font-extralight tracking-tight text-emerald-50 uppercase reveal-text max-w-[70%] leading-none\">FOREST CANOPY</h2>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\">LYR-02</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-emerald-100/90\">\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-light\">#064E3B</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-extralight mt-1 text-emerald-300/60\">R:6 G:78 B:59</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Layer 01: Burnt Terracotta (Core Focus) -->\n            <div class=\"color-card absolute shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(194,65,12,0.25)] flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 bg-orange-700 rounded-sm border border-orange-600/50\"\n                 style=\"top: 28%; left: 32%; width: 38%; height: 44%; transform-style: preserve-3d;\"\n                 data-ex=\"30\" data-ey=\"15\" data-ez=\"120\" data-erx=\"4\" data-ery=\"8\" data-erz=\"-6\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-3xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-white uppercase reveal-text max-w-[85%] leading-tight drop-shadow-sm\">BURNT TERRACOTTA</h2>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-orange-950/80 tracking-wider bg-white/30 px-2 py-1 rounded-sm backdrop-blur-sm\">LYR-01</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-white mt-8\">\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-wide\">#C2410C</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-extralight mt-1 text-orange-100/80\">R:194 G:65 B:12</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Layer 04: Golden Ochre -->\n            <div class=\"color-card absolute shadow-2xl shadow-amber-900/20 overflow-hidden bg-amber-400 rounded-sm\"\n                 style=\"top: 12%; left: 65%; width: 22%; height: 55%; transform-style: preserve-3d;\"\n                 data-ex=\"130\" data-ey=\"-110\" data-ez=\"180\" data-erx=\"-12\" data-ery=\"18\" data-erz=\"12\">\n                <span class=\"absolute top-5 left-5 text-xs font-extralight text-amber-900/60 tracking-wider z-10\">LYR-04</span>\n                <div class=\"absolute right-6 sm:right-8 top-1/2 w-0 h-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-10\">\n                    <h2 class=\"origin-center -rotate-90 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-amber-950 uppercase reveal-text whitespace-nowrap\">GOLDEN OCHRE</h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-5 flex items-start justify-start w-0 h-0 pointer-events-none z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"origin-bottom-left -rotate-90 whitespace-nowrap text-amber-900\">\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-light\">#FBBF24</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-extralight mt-1 text-amber-800/80\">R:251 G:191 B:36</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Layer 03: Dusty Rose -->\n            <div class=\"color-card absolute shadow-xl shadow-stone-400/30 flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-6 bg-rose-200 rounded-sm border border-rose-100\"\n                 style=\"top: 65%; left: 42%; width: 42%; height: 25%; transform-style: preserve-3d;\"\n                 data-ex=\"150\" data-ey=\"130\" data-ez=\"280\" data-erx=\"12\" data-ery=\"8\" data-erz=\"-8\">\n                <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center border-b border-rose-300/40 pb-3\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-rose-900\">#FECDD3</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-rose-800 tracking-wider\">LYR-03</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-end h-full pt-4\">\n                     <p class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-rose-700 mb-2 self-end\">R:254 G:205 B:211</p>\n                     <h2 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-2xl font-light tracking-tight text-rose-950 uppercase reveal-text text-left\">DUSTY ROSE</h2>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Layer 06: Midnight Clay (Apex Layer) -->\n            <div class=\"color-card absolute shadow-[0_15px_40px_rgba(69,10,10,0.2)] flex flex-col justify-between p-4 sm:p-5 bg-red-950 rounded-sm\"\n                 style=\"top: 22%; left: 12%; width: 28%; height: 28%; transform-style: preserve-3d;\"\n                 data-ex=\"-140\" data-ey=\"-30\" data-ez=\"450\" data-erx=\"2\" data-ery=\"-18\" data-erz=\"18\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-red-50 uppercase reveal-text max-w-[80%] leading-none drop-shadow-sm\">MIDNIGHT CLAY</h2>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-red-300/60 tracking-wider\">LYR-06</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-red-100 mt-4\">\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-light\">#450A0A</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs font-extralight mt-1 text-red-200/80\">R:69 G:10 B:10</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-text');\n            revealElements.forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerText;\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                el.innerHTML = '';\n                words.forEach(word => {\n                    const wordContainer = document.createElement('span');\n                    wordContainer.style.cssText = 'overflow: hidden; display: inline-flex; margin-right: 0.25em; vertical-align: top;';\n                    const wordInner = document.createElement('span');\n                    wordInner.innerText = word;\n                    wordInner.style.cssText = 'display: inline-block; transform: translateY(110%); will-change: transform; opacity: 0;';\n                    wordInner.className = 'reveal-word-inner';\n                    wordContainer.appendChild(wordInner);\n                    el.appendChild(wordContainer);\n                });\n            });\n\n            const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.color-card');\n            cards.forEach(card => {\n                const wordsInCard = card.querySelectorAll('.reveal-word-inner');\n                if(wordsInCard.length > 0) {\n                    gsap.to(wordsInCard, {\n                        y: '0%',\n                        opacity: 1,\n                        duration: 1.2,\n                        stagger: 0.1,\n                        ease: \"power3.out\",\n                        delay: 0.3,\n                        scrollTrigger: {\n                            trigger: card,\n                            start: \"top bottom\",\n                        }\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n\n            const container = document.getElementById('composition-container');\n            const isMobile = window.innerWidth < 768;\n            const explodeFactor = isMobile ? 0.35 : 1.1;\n\n            window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 2;\n                const y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 2;\n\n                gsap.to(container, {\n                    rotationX: -y * 15,\n                    rotationY: x * 15,\n                    duration: 2,\n                    ease: \"sine.out\"\n                });\n            });\n\n            container.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {\n                cards.forEach(card => {\n                    gsap.to(card, {\n                        x: parseFloat(card.dataset.ex) * explodeFactor,\n                        y: parseFloat(card.dataset.ey) * explodeFactor,\n                        z: parseFloat(card.dataset.ez) * explodeFactor,\n                        rotationX: parseFloat(card.dataset.erx),\n                        rotationY: parseFloat(card.dataset.ery),\n                        rotationZ: parseFloat(card.dataset.erz),\n                        duration: 1.4,\n                        ease: \"back.out(1.2)\"\n                    });\n                });\n            });\n\n            container.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                cards.forEach(card => {\n                    gsap.to(card, {\n                        x: 0,\n                        y: 0,\n                        z: 0,\n                        rotationX: 0,\n                        rotationY: 0,\n                        rotationZ: 0,\n                        duration: 1.2,\n                        ease: \"power4.out\"\n                    });\n                });\n            });\n        });\n\n        const canvas = document.querySelector('#webgl-canvas');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        camera.position.z = 45;\n\n        // Soft stone-colored network for light theme\n        const material = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n            color: 0x78716C,\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.25,\n            blending: THREE.NormalBlending\n        });\n\n        const particleCount = 120;\n        const positions = new Float32Array(particleCount * 3);\n        const velocities = [];\n\n        for (let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\n            positions[i * 3] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 140;\n            positions[i * 3 + 1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 140;\n            positions[i * 3 + 2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 20;\n            velocities.push({\n                x: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.03,\n                y: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.03,\n                z: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.01\n            });\n        }\n\n        const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n        geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3));\n\n        const lineGroup = new THREE.Group();\n        scene.add(lineGroup);\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n\n        const maxDistance = 20;\n        const maxDistSq = maxDistance * maxDistance;\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n            const posAttr = geometry.attributes.position;\n            const posArray = posAttr.array;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\n                const i3 = i * 3;\n                posArray[i3] += velocities[i].x;\n                posArray[i3 + 1] += velocities[i].y;\n                posArray[i3 + 2] += velocities[i].z;\n\n                if (posArray[i3] > 70 || posArray[i3] < -70) velocities[i].x *= -1;\n                if (posArray[i3 + 1] > 70 || posArray[i3 + 1] < -70) velocities[i].y *= -1;\n                if (posArray[i3 + 2] > 20 || posArray[i3 + 2] < -20) velocities[i].z *= -1;\n            }\n\n            while(lineGroup.children.length > 0){\n                const child = lineGroup.children[0];\n                lineGroup.remove(child);\n                child.geometry.dispose();\n            }\n\n            const linePositions = [];\n            for (let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\n                const i3 = i * 3;\n                for (let j = i + 1; j < particleCount; j++) {\n                    const j3 = j * 3;\n                    const dx = posArray[i3] - posArray[j3];\n                    const dy = posArray[i3 + 1] - posArray[j3 + 1];\n                    const dz = posArray[i3 + 2] - posArray[j3 + 2];\n                    const distSq = dx*dx + dy*dy + dz*dz;\n\n                    if (distSq < maxDistSq) {\n                        linePositions.push(\n                            posArray[i3], posArray[i3 + 1], posArray[i3 + 2],\n                            posArray[j3], posArray[j3 + 1], posArray[j3 + 2]\n                        );\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            if(linePositions.length > 0) {\n                const lineGeom = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n                lineGeom.setAttribute('position', new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(linePositions, 3));\n                const lines = new THREE.LineSegments(lineGeom, material);\n                lineGroup.add(lines);\n            }\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n\n        animate();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "organic-material-system-spatial-interface.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/organic-material-system-spatial-interface.jpg", "source_name": "organic-material-system-spatial-interface-DESIGN.md", "views": 130, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T07:48:29.355233+00:00"}